Set Shell "bash"
Set Width 1850
Set Height 1000
Set FontSize 18
Set Padding 30
Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Set Framerate 60
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.5
Set Theme "rose-pine-moon"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Env COLORTERM "truecolor"
Env TERM "xterm-256color"
Output lilbee-fleet-drawer.mp4
Output lilbee-fleet-drawer.gif

Hide
Type "lilbee-tui"
Enter
Sleep 16s
Show
Sleep 2s
Type "/rebuild"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 1500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Ctrl+g
Sleep 80s
Type "How does lilbee split a large model across multiple GPUs?"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 140s
Sleep 3s
